  "claim": "The Global Food Security Act of 2016, is a law introduced on March 24, 2015 in the 114th Congress by Robert Patrick \"Bob\" Casey Jr. Senator of Pennsylvania, who is an Republican attorney and politician, currently the senior United States Senator from Pennsylvania.",
