        "original_id": "b39113e4-c4bd-5d61-8b94-40ca2e09f5aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Casey Jr., Chris Smith, Barack Obama\n- Laws: Global Food Security Act of 2016\n- Organizations: 114th Congress, United States Senate\n- Places: Pennsylvania, New Jersey\n- Roles: U.S. Senator, Representative, President\n\nFacts:\n- The Global Food Security Act of 2016 was introduced in the 114th Congress on March 24, 2015 by Representative Chris Smith of New Jersey.\n- The Global Food Security Act of 2016 was introduced in the Senate on May 7, 2015 by Senator Bob Casey Jr. of Pennsylvania.\n- Bob Casey Jr. was born on April 13, 1960.\n- Bob Casey Jr. is an American attorney and politician.\n- Barack Obama signed the Global Food Security Act of 2016 into law on July 20, 2016.\n- Bob Casey Jr. is the senior United States Senator from Pennsylvania.",
